00:00:36.838 --> 00:00:40.830
I'm talking of course about
Korean sandwich dramas.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.560
- Subway in South Korea.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:46.230
I did not come to Seoul, South Korea

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.270
to talk about Subway sandwiches.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.370
I am here for a different story,

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:53.130
